	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw with TIME AGGREGATION by year,
as scale-county-timeagg-year (<aggregateBy key="Year"/>, <outputtimestep
value="Year"/>; January, April, July and October 2020, both day types, all 24
hours; road types 1 and 4), for the gasoline passenger car (21) and the
diesel combination long-haul truck (62). It selects the gaseous species and air toxics of scale-county-timeagg-year-toxics
at the OTHER exhaust processes: extended idle and auxiliary power (source type
62), and crankcase running, start and extended idle (CrankcaseEmissionCalculator
chains each species from its parent process). No PM, no evaporative or
refueling process. County database
county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql.]]></description>
